{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What the Louvain method reports, in order."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LouvainEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","text":"DirectedGraph","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each level starts with local moving: level vertices are taken in number order, sweep after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sweep, and each moves to the neighboring community that raises the modularity most, reported"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as it moves. Communities are named by level vertex numbers. When a sweep moves nothing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level is finished, with its partition of the graph’s vertices and that partition’s modularity."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"While the modularity rose by more than the threshold, the communities are then merged into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next level’s vertices, numbered by their labels in the partition just reported. At the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level the level vertices are the graph’s vertices, numbered in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order (their vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indices when the graph has them). The method ends after a level whose modularity did not rise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough, or after an aggregation whose local moving moved nothing."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LouvainEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LouvainEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"LouvainEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvents.swift#L15"},"title":"LouvainEvent","externalID":"s:18CommunityDetection12LouvainEventO","modules":[{"name":"CommunityDetection"}],"symbolKind":"enum","roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/aggregate(vertexCount:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/levelFinished(_:modularity:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/move(_:from:to:gain:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/SQ","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}]